 The Change Management Specialist, SIS will: 
 Maintain and update the integrated SIS change management plan, ensuring alignment of change activities, milestones, risks, dependencies, and deliverables with the overall program plan; 
 Coordinate and document change impact assessments across functional workstreams, including impacts to roles, processes, service delivery, and stakeholder groups; 
