 A degree in a related discipline or the equivalent combination of education and experience; 
 Experience supporting organizational change management initiatives in complex project, transformation, or enterprise-system implementation environments, including stakeholder engagement, change impact assessment, organizational readiness, training, communications, adoption, and sustainment activities; 
