 Ability to gather, validate, analyze, and interpret information from multiple sources to identify trends, readiness gaps, adoption risks, and opportunities for improvement; 
 Proficiency with Microsoft 365 and common project-tracking, survey, presentation, collaboration, web-content, and digital-engagement tools; 
